Block goals after terminal invalid requests

Supervisor helpers previously reduced terminal Codex errors to status text
before Saffron decided whether to retry.
An invalid request therefore entered the ordinary retry loop even though
repeating it could not succeed.

Retain the structured invalid-request category through helper retirement,
block the matching durable goal, and emit the existing goal update and
warning.
Other failures keep retrying, and blocked goals clear any persisted wake.
